  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nMG1TNv.png\" alt=\"關於\"></p>\n<p>想搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-surroundings-fabric-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings</a> 遊玩 Ashen？受夠了內建羅盤使用原版字體紋理，導致與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-16x-custom-font\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ashen's Custom Font</a> 顯得格格不入？那麼這個附加包就是為你量身打造的！</p>\n<p>在載入順序中，請將此資源包置於 Ashen 的<em>上方</em>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>本資源包專為搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-16x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ashen 16x</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-surroundings-fabric-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings</a> 設計與使用。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faim-boot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3c357293-8dfb-410a-a5e3-0d778833e154.webp\" alt=\"Bisect 廣告橫幅\"></a></p>",
